<p>Russia carried out one of the war’s largest aerial assaults against Ukraine over roughly 24 hours, launching waves of long-range drones and missiles that struck cities across the country, Ukrainian officials and multiple news outlets reported. The initial overnight attacks involved about 400 drones and 23 cruise missiles, and later daytime strikes pushed the reported total to 948 drones over a 24-hour period, according to Ukrainian authorities cited by several outlets. Multiple outlets reported at least six people killed, while later tallies in other reports put the death toll at seven or eight, with dozens injured and residential buildings and infrastructure damaged in multiple regions. The attacks came as Russian ground forces also stepped up pressure along the front line, in what Ukrainian and outside observers described as a possible start of a spring offensive. The broad geographic spread of the strikes, including hits in western Ukraine, underscored both the scale of the operation and the continued strain on Ukraine’s air defenses, as rescue crews and emergency workers responded across affected cities.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/vStuIbdBdh003pizDq-WpBq11PCeKbOcI_AgVykB41FFC-oHFpArJm-RD0KRe4gJeRG7n7NbIJnzBma5UPdIFlp8rHLQj4GglsDKay2vKQPahhtISsYyPKzrPFom6xj87TGy-omCg3FcdJ2hUeedxTB-E0BUOYUrSZOR63VuHio5hbEpKbPV2QwpmtRqdv09jf87dnRSJAA-yWIBA_18vxEsgKogrBW9GsVLakF5D8oDsqiGJTWZBb0naiTtyzhxM3jiXzeKqsUrii9oLw' alt='Rescue workers try to put out a fire at a residential building burning after a Russian drone attack on Zaporizhzhia, Ukraine, on March 24, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Civilian-area focus: PBS and SCMP said the barrage hit civilian areas, not just military positions.</li><li>Regional breakdown: BSS highlighted deaths in Poltava and Zaporizhzhia and damage to residential buildings there, adding local detail to the nationwide toll.</li><li>Recent surge: SCMP said the initial overnight barrage was Russia&#x27;s biggest attack in weeks, signaling an escalation even before later waves expanded the 24-hour total.</li><li>Wider geopolitical concern: The Guardian said the assault came amid worries that international attention on the Iran war could leave Ukraine more vulnerable.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Ukrainian military framing: Officials called the barrage the largest drone attack over a 24-hour period of the war, stressing that cities across Ukraine were hit. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cz90gpyw90wo'>BBC News</a>)</li><li>Military assessment in coverage: PBS and other reports said Moscow appeared to be pairing the air barrage with stronger ground pressure, using air and land operations together to stretch Ukrainian defenses. (<a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/russia-fires-400-drones-at-ukraine-signaling-its-spring-offensive-has-started'>PBS NewsHour</a>)</li><li>Emergency responders and local officials: They focused on simultaneous local emergencies — deaths, injuries, fires, and damage to homes and infrastructure — rather than the headline drone count. (<a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-russia-ukraine-drone-missile-attack/'>The Globe and Mail</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-russia-ukraine-drone-missile-attack/'>Russia launches major drone and missile attack on Ukraine</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/russia-fires-400-drones-at-ukraine-signaling-its-spring-offensive-has-started'>Russia fires 400 drones at Ukraine, signaling its spring offensive has started</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3347764/4-dead-russia-fires-nearly-400-drones-ukraine-signs-spring-offensive-has-begun'>Russia fires hundreds of drones at Ukraine in deadly massive attack</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/24/russia-strikes-civilian-areas-ukraine'>Russia fires nearly 1,000 drones in one of its largest aerial attacks on Ukraine</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/russia-fires-nearly-400-drones-at-ukraine-with-signs-its-spring-offensive-has-started/article70781167.ece'>Russia fires nearly 400 drones at Ukraine with signs its spring offensive has started</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/24/world/europe/russia-attack-drones-ukraine-lviv.html'>Russia Launches Daytime Attack on Ukraine With Over 500 Drones</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cz90gpyw90wo'>Russia launches 948 drones at Ukraine in largest attack over 24-hour period</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/03/24/almost-1000-drones-within-24-hours-russia-launched-one-of-its-largest-attacks-on-ukraine'>Almost 1,000 drones within 24 hours: Russia launched one of its largest attacks on Ukraine</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bssnews.net/international/371114'>Russian missile and drone strikes across Ukraine kill at least three people, including two in Poltava and one in Zaporizhzhia, and injures several others. The attacks also damage residential buildings and infrastructure in the areas.</a> - bssnews.net</li></ul>